From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sta: a cond arc set disables the default set only for the
 edges it covers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A liberty pin with a when-conditioned arc set and an unconditioned
default set: when the condition holds, Sim disabled the default set
whole, even for edges the conditioned set has no arc to. ASAP7's ICG
has a CLK->GCLK set conditioned on ENA and SE that carries only the
falling edge; with ENA tied high the rising CLK->GCLK arc went with it,
and nothing behind the gate was clocked: its flops untimed, and
check_setup's "unclocked register/latch pin" count is how it shows.
The default set is now disabled only when the conditioned set covers
every edge it has an arc to.

parallaxsw/OpenSTA#532, not upstreamed from here. Retires on the
//:bump onto an OpenROAD whose OpenSTA carries it.

Signed-off-by: Øyvind Harboe <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
---
diff --git a/src/sta/search/Sim.cc b/src/sta/search/Sim.cc
--- a/src/sta/search/Sim.cc
+++ b/src/sta/search/Sim.cc
@@ -796,6 +796,19 @@ Sim::setIsDisabledCond(Edge *edge,
   }
 }
 
+// cond_set has an arc to every edge arc_set has an arc to.
+static bool
+coversArcs(const TimingArcSet *cond_set,
+           const TimingArcSet *arc_set)
+{
+  for (const TimingArc *arc : arc_set->arcs()) {
+    const RiseFall *to_rf = arc->toEdge()->asRiseFall();
+    if (to_rf == nullptr || cond_set->arcTo(to_rf) == nullptr)
+      return false;
+  }
+  return true;
+}
+
 bool
 Sim::isDisabledCond(Edge *edge,
                     const Instance *inst,
@@ -834,7 +847,8 @@ Sim::isDisabledCond(Edge *edge,
     is_disabled = false;
     for (TimingArcSet *cond_set : cell->timingArcSets(from_port, to_port)) {
       FuncExpr *cond = cond_set->cond();
-      if (cond && evalExpr(cond, inst) == LogicValue::one) {
+      if (cond && evalExpr(cond, inst) == LogicValue::one
+          && coversArcs(cond_set, arc_set)) {
         disable_cond = cond;
         is_disabled = true;
         break;
